11
00:00:19.653 --> 00:00:21.641
H. R.

12
00:00:21.641 --> 00:00:24.436
Rivers in 1906.

13
00:00:25.146 --> 00:00:27.333
Endogamy means marrying within a

14
00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:28.886
